  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.42 with immutable ProGPU preview.48; adopts exact transformed, dashed, fixed-width, shader-backed, and hairline stroke replay, adaptive device-error curve subdivision, allocation-free indexed stroke recording, and preserved DXF cosmetic strokes without a bridge workaround; preserves the typed, zero-allocation ProGPU media drawing-state bridge, native activation, deterministic popup-local input, transparent X11/XWayland visuals, and nonactivating windows; bounds retained render-resource caches and suppresses static-frame GPU rendering; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
